---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = 'November 2, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms" description="Terms of use for Oropis.">
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p>Last updated: {updated}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap narrow prose">
    <h2>Use of the site</h2>
    <p>Oropis is provided for personal, informational use. You may link to stories and quote short excerpts with attribution and a link. Do not republish full articles without permission.</p>

    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>We work from primary sources and correct errors when they are identified. Competitive schedules, rosters, and patch details change quickly. Information is published as of its date and may become outdated.</p>

    <h2>Third-party material</h2>
    <p>Links and credited images may belong to third parties. Their rights remain with their owners. If you believe material is credited incorrectly, contact the desk.</p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>The site is provided “as is” without warranties of any kind. Oropis is not liable for decisions made in reliance on coverage, including betting, fantasy, or roster decisions.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>These terms may be updated as the site evolves. The date above reflects the latest revision.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:abhishek.shinde@oropis.com">abhishek.shinde@oropis.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
